(6535576, 971890, 85430, '<td valign="top">I would have cropped this differently to get rid of the massive black area. In fact, cropping out a significant portion of the right side would also get rid of the little pixels blown out in the yellow areas. Cropping a little more of the bottom area would also give the sky more prominence. <br/> <br/>Maybe you are not a fan of the rule of thirds, but in this case, it may actually make this image so much better.<br/> <br/>I love those colors and the silhouette, by the way.</td>', 'I would have cropped this differently to get rid of the massive black area. In fact, cropping out a significant portion of the right side would also get rid of the little pixels blown out in the yellow areas. Cropping a little more of the bottom area would also give the sky more prominence.  Maybe you are not a fan of the rule of thirds, but in this case, it may actually make this image so much better. I love those colors and the silhouette, by the way.', '2011-09-10 11:08:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6535578, 972137, 85430, '<td valign="top">Real amigos would tell his amigo that he is being photographed. The guy in the center wants to be a solo star.<br/> <br/>Cute photo, by the way :)</td>', 'Real amigos would tell his amigo that he is being photographed. The guy in the center wants to be a solo star. Cute photo, by the way :)', '2011-09-10 11:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
