(6536404, 972173, 117474, '<td valign="top">No, no, no, no. This is all wrong. Though I don''t could JD as a good whiskey, I haven''t tasted this one, but one might be relatively safe in guessing that this single barrel select might be of higher quality than the more populat version. <br/>Coke and ice? Really!? Whiskey is about the taste. The image here is about getting drunk and claiming you''re a whiskey drinker! It''s all wrong!<br/> <br/>You may have guessed I''m an avid whiskey drinker. My advice. Irish or Scotch. No ice. No coke. Get used to it and you''ll become the snob I am :-)  <br/> <br/>I have no problems with your composition. Just the message! We need to communicate proper drinking of whiskey!<br/> <br/>(and yes, I am joking. 7)</td>', 'No, no, no, no. This is all wrong. Though I don''t could JD as a good whiskey, I haven''t tasted this one, but one might be relatively safe in guessing that this single barrel select might be of higher quality than the more populat version. Coke and ice? Really!? Whiskey is about the taste. The image here is about getting drunk and claiming you''re a whiskey drinker! It''s all wrong! You may have guessed I''m an avid whiskey drinker. My advice. Irish or Scotch. No ice. No coke. Get used to it and you''ll become the snob I am :-)   I have no problems with your composition. Just the message! We need to communicate proper drinking of whiskey! (and yes, I am joking. 7)', '2011-09-11 15:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
