(6541064, 972237, 63244, '<td valign="top">Hmm is cosúil, a bheidh le Elliot Nua-Aimseartha tartan ... ceol Míleata .... píobairí d''aois ... go léir cosúil le bheith in ord. Just a mian leo nach raibh na mbarr sin daingean ar bun an leathanaigh.   <br/>Fun shot! <i>IMHO</i>, could use just a touch of shadow/highlight work as is appears a tiny bit washed.  :)</td>', 'Hmm is cosúil, a bheidh le Elliot Nua-Aimseartha tartan ... ceol Míleata .... píobairí d''aois ... go léir cosúil le bheith in ord. Just a mian leo nach raibh na mbarr sin daingean ar bun an leathanaigh.   Fun shot! IMHO, could use just a touch of shadow/highlight work as is appears a tiny bit washed.  :)', '2011-09-15 15:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541065, 972121, 63244, '<td valign="top">LOL! A great capture! Wish the feet weren''t chopped in the crop, but shot does work well in black and white. Not sure about the tiny, thin black line around the white border.</td>', 'LOL! A great capture! Wish the feet weren''t chopped in the crop, but shot does work well in black and white. Not sure about the tiny, thin black line around the white border.', '2011-09-15 15:33:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541066, 972187, 63244, '<td valign="top">LOL! Love the tones on this.</td>', 'LOL! Love the tones on this.', '2011-09-15 15:34:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541069, 972228, 63244, '<td valign="top">Something about the angle here is bothering me. It appears that things are tilting right. If you lined up with the grids on the right side as it appears might be the case, you would have been better off aligning with the building instead. :) It''s advanced, so this could have been straightened. I like the subject matter, but think a crop of some of the right and a bit off the top, leaving the open window may help this. This would produce more of a rule of thirds composition for your subject matter (the people) and perhaps add a bit more interest. ;) Would love to see this revisited (if possible) at a different time of day.</td>', 'Something about the angle here is bothering me. It appears that things are tilting right. If you lined up with the grids on the right side as it appears might be the case, you would have been better off aligning with the building instead. :) It''s advanced, so this could have been straightened. I like the subject matter, but think a crop of some of the right and a bit off the top, leaving the open window may help this. This would produce more of a rule of thirds composition for your subject matter (the people) and perhaps add a bit more interest. ;) Would love to see this revisited (if possible) at a different time of day.', '2011-09-15 15:39:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541070, 972273, 63244, '<td valign="top">Beautiful doggies!!!!! The detail is very good here, but thing seem very bright.</td>', 'Beautiful doggies!!!!! The detail is very good here, but thing seem very bright.', '2011-09-15 15:40:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541073, 972211, 63244, '<td valign="top">I know who you are and you can''t fool me with these getups!!! LOL. Love the tones and the reflections in the glasses are really fun!  (I need those shades!!)</td>', 'I know who you are and you can''t fool me with these getups!!! LOL. Love the tones and the reflections in the glasses are really fun!  (I need those shades!!)', '2011-09-15 15:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
