(6541271, 972243, 77729, '<td valign="top">very cute and creative,strong exposure and great colors,9 for me!</td>', 'very cute and creative,strong exposure and great colors,9 for me!', '2011-09-15 20:35:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541272, 972201, 77729, '<td valign="top">great picture, 9</td>', 'great picture, 9', '2011-09-15 20:36:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541273, 972223, 77729, '<td valign="top">great colors and shadows, I''m usually not a big fan of borders but these work great with the picture, 9 for me.</td>', 'great colors and shadows, I''m usually not a big fan of borders but these work great with the picture, 9 for me.', '2011-09-15 20:39:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6541275, 971676, 107410, '<td valign="top">It looks like something strange happened with the compression or posting. It seems overly sharp/noisy and the dog''s legs in the middle have some kind of weird shadow/desat going on. I also think that this would have had more impact if you were even closer to the ground. Right now, the picture makes me feel like a spectator, if you were lower I think this photo would give the feeling that the dogs are running directly at you.</td>', 'It looks like something strange happened with the compression or posting. It seems overly sharp/noisy and the dog''s legs in the middle have some kind of weird shadow/desat going on. I also think that this would have had more impact if you were even closer to the ground. Right now, the picture makes me feel like a spectator, if you were lower I think this photo would give the feeling that the dogs are running directly at you.', '2011-09-15 20:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
