(6541792, 972186, 108580, '<td valign="top">Yep. Impossible to get kids to co-operate! Have you got a kicker flash or off-camera flash with triggers? Would have nade them stand out a lot and give you some nice silver contrast. I prefer to shoot totally candid from an invisible distance with a 500mm so my victims don;''t know I''m around :) Lovely shot and the BG makes a huge difference. Well handled. 6.x is good.</td>', 'Yep. Impossible to get kids to co-operate! Have you got a kicker flash or off-camera flash with triggers? Would have nade them stand out a lot and give you some nice silver contrast. I prefer to shoot totally candid from an invisible distance with a 500mm so my victims don;''t know I''m around :) Lovely shot and the BG makes a huge difference. Well handled. 6.x is good.', '2011-09-16 08:19:44.000000', NULL, 0),
